node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDQ5MjUwMDM0OTg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/4925003498","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-06-22T20:22:18Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/873153442","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9067#issuecomment-873153442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9067","id":873153442,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg3MzE1MzQ0Mg==","user":{"login":"dmytropiriatenets","id":20107387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTA3Mzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20107387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets","html_url":"https://github.com/dmytropiriatenets","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmytropiriatenets/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-02T17:31:21Z","updated_at":"2021-07-02T17:31:21Z","body":"I've did some checks on top of 2.14.1, this solution works fine.\r\nIn our product we still use ExoPlayer v2.12.1 (since we have the dependency on Amazon, which just recently updated to v2.13.3, and weren't able to migrate to it yet).\r\nSo, I've added similar fix to the DefaultHlsPlaylistTracker (as some method differs from 2.14.1 version)\r\n```\r\n        MediaPlaylistBundle newPrimaryBundle = playlistBundles.get(primaryMediaPlaylistUrl);\r\n        @Nullable HlsMediaPlaylist newPrimarySnapshot = newPrimaryBundle.playlistSnapshot;\r\n        if (newPrimarySnapshot != null && newPrimarySnapshot.hasEndTag) {\r\n            primaryMediaPlaylistSnapshot = newPrimarySnapshot;\r\n            primaryPlaylistListener.onPrimaryPlaylistRefreshed(newPrimarySnapshot);\r\n        } else {\r\n            // The snapshot for the new primary media playlist URL may be stale. Defer updating the\r\n            // primary snapshot until after we've refreshed it.\r\n            newPrimaryBundle.loadPlaylist();\r\n        }\r\n```\r\nand it also worked fine in the application.\r\nThanks @ojw28 for such a quick and tiny yet so important fix for the issue.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/873153442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":nu